{"body":"## Summary\n\nTwo genuinely-new changes on top of `master` (the Stage 10.5 + terminal post-reflect wiring already shipped via #138; this branch was cut clean off `origin/master` to avoid reverting #137):\n\n1. **`fix(reflect): F3a/F3b — e2e-surfaced template guard hygiene`** — surfaced by the 9-agent e2e sweep of #138.\n   - **F3a:** the terminal post-reflection task's negative-guard prose is emitted verbatim into generated tasklists, where a literal `/sc:task` token trips a strict \"no /sc:task in generated output\" scanner. Reworded the five emitted-output guards to `never the \\`sc:task\\` execution command` (drops the slash-prefixed token, keeps the warning). Legitimate `/sc:task` references unchanged.\n   - **F3b:** harden the TCS S6 frozen-extraction rule so a quoted-emoji `type: \"🔧 Refactor\"` value is normalized before matching (previously could read S6=0 and fail to fire override O2 → force `--depth deep`).\n\n2. **`test(reflect): e2e evidence`** — full live run of `/sc:tasklist` (Stages 1–10.5) on a sandbox roadmap, then a `superclaude sprint run` execution of the generated 2-phase bundle, under `.dev/e2e-reflect/`.\n\n## E2E result (live-tl)\n\n- **Stage 10.5 pre-reflect** fanned `N=2` agents (one per phase) after generation; deterministic `depth-map.yaml` (`COMPLEXITY_SCORE=2 → quick/tier-1`); both phases `PASS` 100%.\n- **Sprint outcome:** `success` (2/2 phases). Both terminal `sc:reflect --mode post` tasks ran in fresh executor-disjoint subprocesses.\n- **Gate validation (the payoff):** Phase 1's end-of-phase checkpoint **caught** a real drift — `T01.02` returned `pass` without running its `[COMPLETION]` step, so canonical `D-0002` evidence was never written. The terminal post-reflect independently **classified** it `PARTIAL` (1 Drift / 1 Necessary / 0 Regression) and left an authorize-or-revert decision (no auto-fix). Phase 2 ran clean; its post-reflect confirmed the drift did **not** recur.\n\nThis is preserved deliberately as proof the in-phase checkpoint and the terminal post-reflect corroborate independently.\n\n## Scope / safety notes\n\n- Branch cut from `origin/master`; diff touches **no** `#137` files (`tests/sprint/test_resume.py`, `integrity.py`) — no revert.\n- All committed artifacts live under untracked-until-now `.dev/e2e-reflect/`; `*.log` + `*.pyc` excluded by `.gitignore`. No `.claude/` mirror paths staged (AC11 hook clean).\n\n## Known harness nits (not addressed here — candidate follow-up)\n\n- `phase_name` keeps the leading `- ` from `# Phase N -- Name`.\n- `phase_complete` reports `files_changed: 0` for `.dev/` work.\n- Checkpoint `FAIL/BLOCK` is advisory (sprint proceeds on task `status: pass`).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","files":[{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/CONSOLIDATED-REPORT.md","additions":87,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/README.md","additions":20,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/artifacts/D-0001/evidence.md","additions":25,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/artifacts/D-0003/evidence.md","additions":31,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/artifacts/D-0004/evidence.md","additions":25,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/checkpoints/CP-P01-END.md","additions":89,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/checkpoints/CP-P02-END.md","additions":74,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/execution-log.jsonl","additions":15,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/execution-log.md","additions":15,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/manifest.json","additions":27,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/phase-1-tasklist.md","additions":225,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/phase-2-tasklist.md","additions":225,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/bundle/results/gate-kpi-report.md","additions":31,"deletions":0},{"path":".dev/e2e-reflect/live-tl/